flowchart TD
    Fixtures[Trusted synthetic fixtures and logical clock] --> Messages[Untrusted agent messages]
    Messages --> Identity[Identity registry and wire validation]
    Identity --> Authority[Configured supervisor and bound HMAC claim]
    Authority --> Policy[Immutable global and role policy]
    Policy --> State[Governance state machine]
    State --> Containment[Sticky containment]
    Containment --> Receipt[Deterministic decision receipt]
    Receipt --> Simulated[Simulated outcome only]
    Identity --> Audit[Append-only hash chain]
    Authority --> Audit
    Policy --> Audit
    State --> Audit
    Receipt --> Audit
    Audit --> Replay[Exact experiment replay]
